  <name>Apache NetBeans</name>
  <summary>IDE for Java, PHP, HTML5, JavaScript and more</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Apache NetBeans is a free, open-source integrated development environment (IDE) for quickly and easily developing desktop, web and server-side applications as well as cloud-ready services with Java, JavaScript, HTML5, PHP and more.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>First-class support for Java, JavaScript, PHP, HTML5 and more</li>
      <li>Editors, wizards and templates to help you create applications</li>
      <li>Integrated debugger and profiler</li>
      <li>Git integration</li>
      <li>Light and dark themes</li>
      <li>Extensible via plugins</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
